#. module: concert_halls
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:concert_halls.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Yes. Our concert hall is fully equipped to welcome guests with reduced "
"mobility or special needs. We offer dedicated accessible seating areas, "
"wheelchair spaces, and companion seats. If you require assistance upon "
"arrival, our staff can guide you from the entrance to your seat. Please "
"contact us in advance if you need specific accommodations, such as hearing "
"aid support systems, early access, or personalized assistance, so we can "
"provide the best experience possible."
msgstr ""

#. module: concert_halls
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:concert_halls.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Yes. Several parking options are available within walking distance of the "
"concert hall, including public parking lots and private garages. Some events "
"may offer discounted parking rates—details will be provided on the event "
"page. We also encourage the use of public transportation, as we are "
"conveniently connected to major bus, tram, and metro lines. Bicycle racks "
"are available near the entrance for guests arriving by bike."
msgstr ""

#. module: concert_halls
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:concert_halls.view_page_home
msgid ""
"You can buy tickets directly through our website by visiting the <i>Events</"
"i> section and selecting your preferred show. Each event page displays real-"
"time availability and seating options. Tickets can also be purchased at our "
"on-site box office during opening hours or through our official ticketing "
"partners. We strongly recommend buying tickets only from authorized sellers "
"to avoid scams or invalid entries. Once your purchase is complete, you will "
"receive a confirmation email with your e-ticket, which you can show on your "
"phone or print for entry."
msgstr ""

#. module: concert_halls
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:concert_halls.welcome_article_body
